  "plain": "Jake Barber, who says he helped recover a UFO by helicopter, says on Jesse Michels's podcast that in 2023 in Washington his group quietly passed an explanation to Michael Herrera, a man who tells his own story of seeing a strange craft. The explanation involved \"psionic asset transfer,\" the idea that people with mind-based abilities play a part in how these craft appear, and Barber says plainly, \"That was us.\" If true, it would mean a group with inside knowledge was shaping what witnesses understood about their own experiences."
